        "gg0ueUx8y82_text": "Ease Tummy",
        "ggBjp_uWRuu_text": "<p>Be it hot flashes, night sweats, mood swings, brain fog, low energy, or any other menopause-related symptoms caused by hormonal fluctuations, MenoMate helps support the body in maintaining equilibrium naturally for a happier, healthier you.</p>",
        "ggDJzdNX-jB_text": "Ease Life",
        "ggJj0auocs0_text": "<p>Being “heavy-in-the-middle” is one of the top concerns for women over 40. MenoMate's abdominal-fat-management formula helps women look &amp; feel fabulous in the latest styles, cuts and fits from t.</p>",
        "ggO7Jp0LF5T_text": "<p>Occasional digestive issues after 40 often prevent women from enjoying life to the fullest. MenoMate's formula is specially designed to support a healthy digestive system and keep the tummy calm and relaxed.</p>",
        "ggZ-A5Fvopf_text": "Ease Rest",
